---
// 주방 보조: 평택센터 멤버가 2주 단위로 오전·점심·저녁 준비 / 클린업을 신청한다. 한 칸에 여러 명이 신청할 수 있고, 신청한 사람에게는 식사 1시간 전에 알림톡(실패하면 문자)이 간다.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <script is:inline src="/wolko-lang-sync.js?v=2"></script>
  <script is:inline src="/wolko-scroll-lock.js?v=1"></script>
  <title>주방 보조 — WOLKO</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/WOLKO Circle.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wolko-lang-toggle.css?v=2">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/car-log.css?v=7">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/car-drive.css?v=17">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/kitchen.css?v=2">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wolko-rail.css?v=18">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wolko-header.css?v=14">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wolko-ui.css?v=4">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wolko-layout.css?v=15">
  <script src="/wolko-rail.js?v=30" defer></script>
  <script src="/kitchen.js?v=3" defer></script>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#004f68">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="car-header">
    <a class="car-header-logo" href="/portal" title="WOLKO 포탈로 돌아가기">
      <img src="/images/WOLKO Circle.png" alt="WOLKO">
      <span data-t="pageTitle">주방 보조</span>
    </a>
    <div class="car-header-right">
      <div class="wl-lang-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Language">
        <button type="button" class="wl-lang-btn" id="langKoBtn" aria-label="한국어" title="한국어"><img src="https://flagcdn.com/w20/kr.png" alt=""><span>KO</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="wl-lang-btn" id="langEnBtn" aria-label="English" title="English"><img src="https://flagcdn.com/w20/us.png" alt=""><span>EN</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="log-wrap drive-wrap">
    <p class="wl-lead" data-t="intro">주방 준비와 클린업을 신청하세요. 식사 1시간 전에 카카오톡(안 되면 문자)으로 알려드려요.</p>

    <p class="log-loading" id="loadStatus" data-t="loading">불러오는 중…</p>

    <section class="log-panel" id="loginPanel" hidden>
      <div class="log-panel-head"><span class="log-step">01</span><h2 data-t="loginTitle">포탈 로그인</h2></div>
      <p class="log-help" data-t="loginHelp">평택센터 멤버의 포탈 계정으로 로그인해 주세요.</p>
      <form id="loginForm" class="log-form">
        <label><span data-t="email">이메일</span><input id="loginEmail" type="email" autocomplete="username" required></label>
        <label><span data-t="password">비밀번호</span><input id="loginPassword" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label>
        <button class="log-primary" type="submit" data-t="loginBtn">로그인하고 계속하기</button>
      </form>
      <p class="log-error" id="loginError" role="alert"></p>
    </section>

    <section class="log-panel" id="deniedPanel" hidden>
      <h2 data-t="deniedTitle">평택센터 멤버 전용이에요</h2>
      <p class="log-help" data-t="deniedHelp">이 스케줄은 평택센터 멤버만 사용할 수 있어요. 소속이 맞는데 이 안내가 보이면 관리자에게 문의해 주세요.</p>
    </section>

    <div id="driveApp" hidden>
      <div class="drive-bar">
        <button type="button" class="drive-nav" id="prevPeriod" aria-label="prev">‹</button>
        <div class="drive-period"><strong id="periodLabel"></strong></div>
        <button type="button" class="drive-nav" id="nextPeriod" aria-label="next">›</button>
        <button type="button" class="drive-today" id="thisPeriod" data-t="thisPeriod">오늘로</button>
        <button type="button" class="drive-manage" id="manageBtn" data-t="manage" hidden>칸 관리</button>
        <button type="button" class="drive-manage" id="timesBtn" data-t="timesBtn" hidden>시간·인원</button>
      </div>
      <p class="drive-manage-hint" id="manageHint" data-t="manageHint" hidden>칸을 눌러 닫거나 열고, 정원을 바꾸고, 사람을 직접 배정해요. 아침 칸과 금요일 저녁~화요일 아침은 기본으로 닫혀 있어서, 필요한 날만 열어 주세요.</p>
      <div id="weeks"></div>
      <p class="drive-note" id="note"></p>
      <p class="drive-note" id="noteMeals"></p>
      <p class="log-error" id="driveError" role="alert"></p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <div class="drive-modal" id="assignModal" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="assignTitle">
    <div class="drive-modal-card">
      <h3 id="assignTitle"></h3>
      <p class="drive-modal-when" id="assignState"></p>
      <div class="kitchen-people-list" id="assignPeople"></div>
      <label><span data-t="assignPick">담당자 직접 배정</span><select id="assignSelect"></select></label>
      <p class="drive-times-default" id="assignFull" hidden></p>
      <button type="button" class="log-primary" id="assignDo" data-t="assignDo">배정하기</button>
      <label><span data-t="capLabel">이 칸 정원</span><select id="capSelect"></select></label>
      <p class="log-error" id="assignError" role="alert"></p>
      <div class="drive-assign-actions">
        <button type="button" class="log-secondary" id="assignToggle"></button>
        <button type="button" class="log-secondary" id="assignCancel" data-t="close">닫기</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="drive-modal" id="timesModal" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="timesTitle">
    <div class="drive-modal-card">
      <h3 id="timesTitle" data-t="timesTitle">식사 시간 · 기본 인원</h3>
      <p class="log-help" data-t="timesHelp">알림은 식사 시간 1시간 전에 신청한 분께 카카오 알림톡(실패하면 문자)으로 가요. 30분 단위로 고를 수 있어요.</p>
      <div class="drive-times-grid kitchen-times-grid" id="timesGrid"></div>
      <label><span data-t="capDefaultLabel">한 칸의 기본 인원</span><select id="timeCapacity"></select></label>
      <p class="log-error" id="timesError" role="alert"></p>
      <button type="button" class="drive-times-reset" id="timesReset" data-t="timesReset">기본값으로 되돌리기</button>
      <p class="drive-times-default" data-t="timesDefaultNote">기본: 아침 9:00 · 점심 12:30 · 저녁 5:00 · 준비 1명 · 클린업 2명 (칸마다 따로 바꿀 수 있어요 — 준비 최대 2명, 클린업 최대 4명)</p>
      <div class="drive-modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="log-secondary" id="timesCancel" data-t="cancel">취소</button>
        <button type="button" class="log-primary" id="timesSave" data-t="save">저장</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="drive-modal" id="phoneModal" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="phoneTitle">
    <div class="drive-modal-card">
      <h3 id="phoneTitle" data-t="phoneTitle">알림 받을 번호</h3>
      <p class="log-help" data-t="phoneHelp">식사 1시간 전에 이 번호로 카카오톡(안 되면 문자)을 보내드려요.</p>
      <p class="drive-modal-when" id="phoneWhen"></p>
      <label><span data-t="phoneLabel">휴대폰 번호</span><input id="phoneInput" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="010-1234-5678"></label>
      <p class="log-error" id="phoneError" role="alert"></p>
      <div class="drive-modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="log-secondary" id="phoneCancel" data-t="cancel">취소</button>
        <button type="button" class="log-primary" id="phoneOk" data-t="signUp">신청하기</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
